          <p>We may share your information with trusted third parties, including Payment Gateway Providers, Delivery and Logistics Partners, Technology and Hosting Service Providers, Customer Support Vendors, Marketing and Analytics Service Providers, Professional Advisors and Auditors, Government Authorities and Law Enforcement Agencies (when required by law), and Business successors in the event of a merger, acquisition, or restructuring.</p>

